OL,3,CWelsh cyclist Finlay Tarling, 19, dies
OL,4,Cafter Portugal race accident
OL,6,FBritish cyclist Finlay Tarling, who
OL,7,Fwas born in Ceredigion, has died at
OL,8,Fthe age of 19 following a serious
OL,9,Faccident during a road race in
OL,10,FPortugal.
OL,12,FFinley Tarling was riding for the NSN
OL,13,FDevelopment Team and taking part in
OL,14,Fthe eighth stage of the Volta a
OL,15,FPortugal in the north of the country
OL,16,Fwhen the accident occured.
OL,18,FTarling is the younger brother of
OL,19,FIneos Grenadiers cyclist Josh and had
OL,20,Fraced for Great Britain on the road
OL,21,Fand track.
