OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F436A1786945672
OL,3,CWelsh cyclist Finlay Tarling, 19, dies
OL,4,Cafter Portugal race accident
OL,6,FIn a statement, NSN Cycling Team said:
OL,7,F"We are heartbroken to announce the
OL,8,Fpassing of Finlay Tarling at the Volta
OL,9,Fa Portugal today.
OL,11,F"Fin was a much loved member of our
OL,12,Fteam but most importantly, he was a
OL,13,Fson, a brother, and a friend to so
OL,14,Fmany. He will be deeply missed.
OL,16,F"Our deepest condolences go out to
OL,17,FFin's parents Michael and Dawn, his
OL,18,Fbrother Josh, and everyone who was
OL,19,Flucky enough to call Fin a friend.
OL,20,FRest in peace, Fin."
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@AOUxD@AOU|D@TO]
