OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F436A1786945672
OL,3,CWelsh cyclist Finlay Tarling, 19, dies
OL,4,Cafter Portugal race accident
OL,6,FRace organisers and the Portuguese
OL,7,FCycling Federation posted on X their
OL,8,F"most heartfelt condolences to the
OL,9,Ffamily of Finlay Tarling, to his team-
OL,10,Fmates, to the NSN Development Team,
OL,11,Fand to all his friends and loved ones.
OL,13,F"In light of this tragic event, the
OL,14,Frace will be neutralised until
OL,15,Freaching Fafe and, as a sign of
OL,16,Frespect and mourning, the podium
OL,17,Fceremony scheduled for today will not
OL,18,Ftake place."
